    "goal": "Extrude bioink through a standard-6 (150 µm) nozzle along a 47766 µm G-code path at 42.22 mm/min to fill a 41999 µm footprint at 768 µm line pitch, and report fill lines, print time, deposition rate, extruded volume and filament mass.",
